      "text": "```\nMOLLUSCA TREE\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    MOLLUSCA                              |\n|                 ~85,000 species                          |\n|                                                          |\n|   Aculifera                     Conchifera               |\n|  (small, shell-less/             (shelled forms)         |\n|   8-plated)                                              |\n|     |                    +----------+----------+         |\n| Solenogastres        Monoplacophora  Gastropoda          |\n| Caudofoveata         (single cap     (snails,slugs)      |\n| Polyplacophora       shell)          ~70,000 sp          |\n|  (chitons, 8 plates)                                     |\n|                                                          |\n|  Bivalvia    Scaphopoda  Cephalopoda                     |\n|  (clams,     (tusk       (octopus,                       |\n|   oysters)    shells)     squid)                         |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+"
    },
