      "text": "THE MOLLUSCAN BODY PLAN (hypothetical ancestral mollusk):\n+--------------------------------------------------+\n|  Head (anterior)                                 |\n|  Muscular foot (ventral locomotion)              |\n|  Mantle (dorsal soft tissue covering)            |\n|    ├── Secretes shell (calcium carbonate)        |\n|    └── Encloses mantle cavity (with ctenidia)    |\n|  Visceral mass (organs: heart, kidney, gonads)   |\n|  Radula (rasping feeding organ)                  |\n+--------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
