      "text": "```\nTORSION: ~180° rotation of visceral mass during development\n         (happens in hours to days as larva)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MOLLUSCA.md#019",
      "path": [
        "05-MOLLUSCA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:animal-phylogeny:05-mollusca, git-history:animal-phylogeny:05-mollusca]",
