        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Mollusca - The Second Most Species-Rich Animal Phylum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nSHELL COILING TERMINOLOGY\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n|  Dextral (right-handed)  Most common (R→R→R)  |\n|  Sinistral (left-handed) Rare (L→L→L)         |\n|  Planispiral             Flat coil (Nautilus) |\n|  Conical                 High spire           |\n|  Limpet                  Cap-shaped, uncoiled |\n+-----------------------------------------------+"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MOLLUSCA.md#024",
      "path": [
